# The Semitexa agent skills, and who may install them (skills-install.sh).
#
#   name  scope  source
#
# scope:
#   workspace  the framework's own process (pull requests, review, releases):
#              installed only in the semitexa.dev workspace, never globally
#   project    for a project built on Semitexa: installable in it, or globally
# source: the skill's directory, relative to this file.
#
# A skill name may appear twice, once per scope: an agent says "make it" in
# either place and gets the edition that belongs there.
codereview          workspace  skills/codereview
make-it             workspace  skills/make-it
package-quality     workspace  skills/package-quality
release-readiness   workspace  skills/release-readiness
release-repair      workspace  skills/release-repair
review-prep         workspace  skills/review-prep
